          "children": [
            {
              "type": "tagname",
              "key": "@@standfirst",
              "props": {},
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "The world's most glamorous flying pig, Nanny Piggins tells side-splitting stories and fractured fairytales for curious kids."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tagname",
              "key": "p",
              "props": {},
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "The stories are perfect for bedtime, long car rides or even if you're just stuck waiting a really, really long time at the doctor's office. Written with kids aged 7–11 in mind, these are tales the whole family can enjoy, because silliness is ageless. If you're into cake, danger and dodging responsibility, you'll love Bedtime Stories with R.A. Spratt. Remember, these myths and fairytales were written in the ancient story times so may reference silly ancient violence and occasional pigism."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tagname",
              "key": "p",
              "props": {},
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "R.A. Spratt (Rachel Spratt) is a beloved Australian children's author, television writer, and podcast host, best known for creating the Nanny Piggins series, along with Friday Barnes, Girl Detective,The Peski Kids and Hamlet Is Not OK. She's also responsible for story collections like Shockingly Good Stories and Epically Good Greek Myths and most recently, The Epically Awesome Odyssey as told by Nanny Piggins."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tagname",
              "key": "p",
              "props": {},
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Stories written and performed by R.A. Spratt."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
